
@startuml
title RBciAD — Architecture (sequence fallback, no Graphviz required)

participant GUI
participant Engine
participant "Plugins (Python)" as Plugins
participant Polyglot
participant "I/O" as IO

GUI -> Engine: Edit graph / parameters
Engine -> Plugins: Discover & run nodes
Engine -> Polyglot: Invoke external step (JSON I/O)
IO -> Plugins: EDF/BDF/GDF/LSL data
Plugins -> IO: Sinks (Plots/Web/CSV)
Engine -> IO: Metrics logger

note right of Polyglot
  Wrapper writes per instance:
  input_<name>_<id>.json
  output_<name>_<id>.json
end note

note over GUI,Engine
  No-/Low-code editor (palette, drag & connect)
  Reactive engine (RxPy): deterministic propagation
end note

@enduml
